# Flask template caching (a2admz)

The A2A gateway (`a2admz.py`) runs with `FLASK_DEBUG=0` by default. Jinja2 templates under `templates/` are cached in that mode.

After editing admin UI HTML/Jinja templates, **restart the `a2admz.py` process** before expecting changes in the browser. A browser hard-refresh alone is not enough.

```bash
# restart gateway after template changes
pkill -f a2admz.py
cd /home/greg/llmdmz && .venv/bin/python a2admz.py
```

Python changes in `dmz/admin_routes.py` also require a restart. Tell the user to hard-refresh after restart to avoid stale browser cache.
